<title>UK: Saint Gobain sets $50 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Saint Gobain sets $50 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE DE SAINT GOBAIN</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.955    LISTING    NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
